        "evidence": [
          "lib/services/playback/music_player_runtime.dart:12 imports lib/services/playback/music_player_service.dart.",
          "lib/services/playback/music_player_service.dart:25 imports lib/services/playback/music_player_runtime.dart and :41 re-exports it (export 'music_player_runtime.dart').",
          "Packet dependencies.cycle_summaries lists the 2-file cycle; complexity_hotspots places music_player_service.dart at 2072 LOC, so the cycle sits on the largest playback file."
        ],
        "suggestion": "Move the types the runtime needs out of music_player_service.dart into a small shared file (for example playback_runtime_types.dart) that both files import, and drop the export of music_player_runtime.dart from the service, so the runtime depends on nothing that depends back on it.",
        "reasoning": "",
